# Core lifecycle only. Commands, timings and receipts belong to Org.
title: WEAVER / NATIVE SEMANTICS / FINAL EFFECT BOUNDARY {
  class: title
  near: top-center
}
source: SCHEME / DEFINING OWNERS {
  left: 0
  top: 0
  width: 370
  height: 650
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 16
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  contract: JSON and parser semantic Contract\nOriginal binding owners and ABI\nRequired initializer closure {
    left: 20
    top: 85
    width: 330
    height: 115
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  closure: Narrow I/O to defining owners\nPack admitted pure dynamic bodies\nPreserve independent linker entries {
    left: 20
    top: 270
    width: 330
    height: 115
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  image: Coherent native source rebuild\nShared images / distinct lazy modules\nInstalled ordinary gxi {
    left: 20
    top: 455
    width: 330
    height: 115
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
}
lifecycle: GXI / DYNAMIC EXECUTION {
  left: 460
  top: 0
  width: 370
  height: 650
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 16
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  checks: Original expander / defining owners\nOS library validation / real native load\nIndependent lazy module entries {
    left: 20
    top: 85
    width: 330
    height: 115
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  return: Original Contract assertions\nDecode unchanged configuration\nPreserve every native acquisition {
    left: 20
    top: 270
    width: 330
    height: 115
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  exit: Normal return / reject late initialization\nClose every reference / run destructors\nRelease image after its final close {
    left: 20
    top: 455
    width: 330
    height: 115
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
}
authority: GATEWAY / EFFECT AUTHORITY {
  left: 920
  top: 0
  width: 370
  height: 650
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 16
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  evidence: Native bodies / required initializers\nPass / fail / late evidence retained\nFailed candidate stays unqualified\nNo execution permission minted {
    left: 20
    top: 85
    width: 330
    height: 115
    label.near: center-center
    class: ledger
  }
  go: Go cloud native control\nPublish typed proposals\nPreserve task and reservation {
    left: 20
    top: 270
    width: 330
    height: 115
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  broker: Rust final broker and executor\nCurrent Cedar Policy / history join\nFenced actual provider dispatch {
    left: 20
    top: 455
    width: 330
    height: 115
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
}
quint: QUINT / EXECUTABLE COUNTEREXAMPLES\nLate exit / failed series / unsafe evidence {
  left: 50
  top: 740
  width: 575
  height: 90
  class: policy
}
lean: LEAN / COMPOSITION\nReceipt retention / series rejection / actual Policy guard {
  left: 740
  top: 740
  width: 575
  height: 90
  class: semantic
}
